<view class="page promise-page" style="{{brandStyle}}">
  <view class="promise-head">
    <view class="promise-head__eyebrow">SERVICE PROMISE</view>
    <view class="promise-head__title">{{theme.shopName}} 的服务承诺</view>
    <view class="promise-head__slogan" wx:if="{{theme.slogan}}">{{theme.slogan}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="proof-strip">
    <view class="proof-strip__item" wx:for="{{proofs}}" wx:key="value">
      <view class="proof-strip__value">{{item.value}}</view>
      <view class="proof-strip__label">{{item.label}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="promise-card card" wx:for="{{promises}}" wx:key="title">
    <image class="promise-card__icon" src="{{item.icon}}" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="promise-card__body">
      <view class="promise-card__title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="promise-card__text">{{item.text}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card flow-card">
    <view class="section-title">服务确认流程</view>
    <view class="flow-row" wx:for="{{flows}}" wx:key="step">
      <view class="flow-row__step">{{item.step}}</view>
      <view class="flow-row__body">
        <view class="flow-row__title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="flow-row__text">{{item.text}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card statement">
    <view class="section-title">价格透明声明</view>
    <view class="statement__text">
      小程序价格表展示的是当前门店公开服务价。预约提交后，订单会记录下单时的价格版本；如需额外服务，门店应先说明内容和费用，再由家属确认。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card statement">
    <view class="section-title">联系与确认</view>
    <view class="statement__text">
      提交预约后，门店会根据订单信息联系你确认时间、地址和服务细节。若你对流程有任何不放心，可以先联系门店再预约。
    </view>
    <button class="btn-plain statement__btn" bindtap="callShop">联系门店</button>
  </view>

  <view class="promise-actions">
    <button class="btn-plain" bindtap="goPrices">查看价格</button>
    <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="goCreate">立即预约</button>
  </view>
</view>
